SUMMARY:Muslimah Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:July 26th\, 2026\nOur Muslimah Farmers Market 💕 \n\nTake a stroll through our beautiful vendor market and discover amazing local businesses offering handcrafted goods\, stationery\, wellness products\, sweet treats\, home décor\, gifts\, and so much more! 🤍\n\nTreat yourself to something special 🤭\n\n📍 Erin Hill Acres\n🗓️ This Sunday | 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM\n\nSee you at the market! 🌸
LOCATION:Erin Hill Acres
CATEGORIES:Gatherings
