BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fighofsalaahs@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260819T165641Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260802
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Fiqh of Salah
DESCRIPTION:Every Sunday in August from 2:15–3:15pm\nReady for a month of the Fiqh of Salah? 🤲🏻\n\nJoin us every Sunday in August from 2:15–3:15 PM for our 4-part Halaqa Series led by @almukhlisinstitute at @ismsisters : learning\, where we’ll gather as sisters to reflect\, connect\, and grow in faith through learning about Salah (prayer).\n\n✨ Drinks provided\n🤍 Sisters 16+\n📍Every Sunday in August | 2:15–3:15 PM
LOCATION:Markham
CATEGORIES:Gatherings
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:MuslimahDining@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260819T165641Z
SUMMARY:Muslimah Dining
DESCRIPTION:August 22 and August 30th!\nMuslimah's Dining gets it. That's why we've launched this community building initiative\, where you get to be matched up with three to five other amazing Muslimah women\, just like you\, once a month. \n\nMeeting inspiring Muslimahs working on their deen and dunya\, shouldn't be rare. Muslimah's Dining will be matching you up based on the information you provide below and a matching approach that places importance on group compatibility. Register by filling out the form below for our next match-up and meet three to five new Muslimahs over dinner InshaAllah.
LOCATION:Toronto and Mississauga
CATEGORIES:Gatherings
END:VEVENT
